+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+A client MAY request its conversation metadata with `list_conversations`; the request has no user id because the server takes the user exclusively from the authenticated connection. `limit`, when present, is an integer from 1 through 200; `before`, when present, is a complete `{updatedAt, sessionId}` cursor with an ISO `updatedAt`. The server ignores any extra field, including a supplied user id ([validated by: accepts only a bounded list frame with a complete ISO cursor, and drops a supplied user id](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L91)).
